    [CI] Enable 310p-1 test sharding (#18164)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    The execution duration of 310p is the longest in the PR. In this PR,
    parallel scheduling of 310p is added, which is expected to reduce the
    execution duration of 310p by 25%.
